{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想在海邊活動前掌握潮漲潮退的準確時刻，Tidal Arc 把潮汐預測化成直觀曲線，適合衝浪、海灘散步、挖蜆、劃獨木舟，以及任何日程需要配合潮汐的人。原價 US $2.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>主畫面與鎖定屏幕即時看潮汐</h2>\n<p>Tidal Arc 把潮汐預測化成流暢曲線，在主畫面與鎖定屏幕一眼看清。中型小工具顯示當日完整潮汐與即時位置，小型小工具倒數下次潮漲潮退。程式內建超過 3,400 個美國 NOAA 官方潮汐站，其他地區可搜尋全球海灘港口，由手機以衛星潮汐模型即時運算，海邊離線亦可用。支援英尺或米，並可開啟潮漲潮退通知，無需帳戶、無訂閱、無廣告。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-315-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-316-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-317-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-318-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-319-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Tidal Arc: Tide Times High Low</li>\n<li>應用類別：Weather</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:48.957241+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}